%% WiFi Test Orchestrator architecture baseline 0.1.0
sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Authorized operator
    participant S as Reservation Service
    participant N as Traffic Node
    participant A as Agent

    O->>S: Request traffic test
    S->>S: Validate RBAC, policy, capability and authorized target
    S->>N: Query available capacity
    N-->>S: Capacity and constraints
    S->>S: Resolve inherited limits into concrete effective limits
    S-->>A: Task referencing server-issued reservation
    S-->>N: Reservation authorization
    A->>A: Verify agent, execution, destination and limits
    A->>N: Open reserved data-plane flow
    N->>N: Enforce destination, protocol, time and resource limits
    N-->>A: Test traffic and provider result
    A->>S: Report result, reservation and effective limits
